B.Jo=s(["Timing Side-Channel Defense (TimingSafe): Constant-time equality checks for OTPs, MPINs, transaction signatures, and auth tokens.","Sensitive Memory Protection (SensitiveValue<T>): Zeroizable, leak-proof memory wrapper that suppresses raw values from logs, crash reports, and JSON telemetry.","Comprehensive PII Redactor (BharatPiiRedactor): Auto-detects and redacts Aadhaar (UIDAI rules), VIDs, PANs, Luhn-verified cards, CVVs, bank accounts, UPI VPAs, and phones in text and JSON maps.","Zero-Dependency Cryptographic Integrity (BharatHash): Pure-Dart RFC 6234 SHA-256 and RFC 2104 HMAC-SHA256 payload signing and payment checksum verification.","Anti-Keylogging & Anti-Clipboard Guards: Disables third-party cloud keyboard harvesting and clipboard snooping on sensitive financial inputs.","Anti-Brute Force Guard (AntiBruteForceGuard): Sliding-window rate limiter to throttle credential and OTP guessing attacks."],t.s)
B.NW=new A.hd("Enterprise Fintech Security","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","BharatSecurity","Timing side-channel defenses, memory isolation, auto PII masking, pure-Dart cryptographic hashing, and anti-tamper guards.",B.Jo,"// Constant-time OTP check & leak-proof memory\nfinal isMpinValid = TimingSafe.verify(enteredMpin, serverHash);\nfinal token = SensitiveValue<String>('secure_auth_session');\n// Redacts Aadhaar, PAN, UPI VPAs from JSON logs\nfinal sanitizedJson = BharatPiiRedactor.redactMap(requestPayload);")
