B.O2=new A.hd("NPCI UPI Intent & Fraud Defenses","\ud83d\udcf1","BharatUpiIntent & BharatUpi","Deep link upi://pay tampering verification, transaction amount ceilings, and zero-width / homoglyph anti-phishing defense.",B.I1,"final upi = BharatUpiIntent.parse('upi://pay?pa=merchant@upi&pn=Store&am=500000');\n// Defend against invisible characters & homoglyph phishing\nfinal isSafeHandle = BharatUpi.detectHomoglyphPhishing(upi.payeeVpa);\nfinal isCompliant = upi.verifyPayloadIntegrity();")
